ss=\"bullet\">Click on FALSE if the statement is false.</span> ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}]}], "id": 9, "stimuli_ids": [2]}, {"template_override": 2, "type": "SFL", "questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "come", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"run-on-question\"></span><span class=\"strong\">Angie</span>: Do you think he'll", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": "to the party?</p>", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "id": 0}, {"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "'s meeting", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Gilly</span>: No. He", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": "Sandra at 8p.m. They're", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "id": 1}, {"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "going to see", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": "a movie. </p>", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "id": 2}, {"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "start", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Angie</span>: Does the movie", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": "at 9 p.m.?</p> <span class=\"strong\">Gilly</span>: Yes. Maybe they", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "id": 3}, {"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "'ll come", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": "here after.", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "id": 4}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I saw Tom earlier today.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Move the words from the box to correctly complete the sentences.", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": 2, "type": "template_override"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}]}], "id": 10, "stimuli_ids": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "RSLT", "questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le07ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le07ob03re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn6le07ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn6le07ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hey Peter. How was the blind date with Tracy?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: It's funny you should ask!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: So, I'm at the coffee shop. Tracy is coming to meet me in about 10 minutes. I'm thinking,  maybe I'll get a good table. I'll get a good table.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Uh huh.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn6le07ob03re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: A tall willowy woman walks in and slowly saunters over. She introduces herself formally. She's quite alluring. She's engaging. I'm very happy. She thinks I'm witty.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Nice!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: She says she's going to go to the ladies. She'll be back in a jiff. I'm waiting patiently. The movie starts at 9 so there's lots of time. We're not leaving for another half hour.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Then, another girl comes in. She's quite distinctive. She walks over confidently and says she's going to introduce herself. She's Tracy.", "id": 2, "time": "14300"}, {"image": "engenn6le07ob03re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Another Tracy?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes. I'm looking at her questioningly. I'm perplexed. Then she mentions Frank. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Gosh! </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: The first Tracy comes back. They know each other!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Really?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Turns out her blind date is sitting two tables over. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No way.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: It was an interesting evening.", "id": 3, "time": "51500"}]}}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "text", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "p", "value": "<br/><br/><br/><br/>Tamara came to meet Fred for lunch at the restaurant. She walked over to the table slowly and sat down confidently. Fred was nervous and spoke formally. He said, \"I am so glad to meet you.\""}], "id": 2}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Peter Goes on a Blind Date", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Chatting Away", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Grammar - part 3 > Are You Tracy?", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 7, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Adverbs of Manner", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use adverbs of manner to describe how something is done.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "She's introduces herself formally.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "He's waiting patiently. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She walked over confidently.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I looked at her questioningly.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Example: <span class=\"italic\">She strongly voiced her concerns.</span></br> How did she voice her concerns? Strongly. </p> Many adverbs are formed by adding -ly to an adjective:</br> Examples:   <span class=\"italic\"> &nbsp; &nbsp;\tquick \u2192 quickly   &nbsp; &nbsp;        \tactive \u2192 actively</span></br> Some adverbs are formed by adding -ally</br> Example:  <span class=\"italic\">&nbsp; &nbsp; public \u2192  publicly</span></p>  These adverbs can come after the direct object or after the verb if there isn't any direct object.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Future", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use different tenses to talk about the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Tracy is coming to meet me in about 10 minutes. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'm thinking, maybe I'll get a good table.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She says she's going to go to the ladies. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The movie starts at 9 so there's lots of time. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When you talk about things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.</p>  With <span class=\"italic\">will</span> you use words like <span class=\"italic\"> perhaps</span>, <span class=\"italic\">maybe</span> and  <span class=\"italic\">I think </span> to show you are still not sure. </p> When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span>. With <span class=\"italic\">going to</span> you often use words like  <span class=\"italic\">sometimes</span>, <span class=\"italic\">soon</span> and <span class=\"italic\">when I have time</span>  to show you intend to do this, but you do not have not set a specific time.</p>  When you  talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the Present Continuous tense. With the Present Continuous, you use specific times and dates to show this event is booked. </p> Many people use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span> in place of the Present Continuous tense. </p>  You use the Simple Present tense to talk about future schedules. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'll eat sit here!\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We're all going to see a movie later.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I\u2018m meeting Tracy at the coffee shop. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Present</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The movie starts at 8 p.m.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "perplexed", "type": "name"}, {"content": "unable to understand or think clearly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: When Sarah didn't understand things, she was perplexed.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when describing people's routines.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "patiently", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to remain calm and relaxed under pressure", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peter has been patiently waiting for friends for a while.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "engaging", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very pleasing in a way that holds your attention", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peter found his date to be very engaging.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "alluring", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having a quality that attracts us to things or people", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peter said his date was very alluring.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "go to the ladies", "type": "name"}, {"content": "uses the ladies' washroom", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She went to the ladies.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to saunter", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to walk slowly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She sauntered over to the table.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "back in a jiff", "type": "name"}, {"content": "will return quickly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She'll be back in a jiff.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "it's funny you should ask", "type": "name"}, {"content": "what a coincidence", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's funny you should ask. I was just going to tell you that!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob03aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "witty", "type": "name"}, {"content": "funny in an intelligent way", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She thought I was witty.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob03aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "willowy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "slender; with long arms and legs", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She was tall and willowy.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob03aud10", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Think about a time in your life when you or someone you know had a mix-up.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a description of the mix-up in 100 words.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain, where, when, and why it all happened.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain how people behaved or did things.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your story aloud.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write about a mix-up.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe, where, when, and why it happened.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I say how people behaved or did things.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my story aloud.", "type": "text"}]}]}